+Autonomy & Closed-Loop Scaffolds
+--------------------------------
+
+What this patch provides:
+ - Drift detector (services/autonomy/drift_detector.py)
+ - Sampler for active labeling (services/autonomy/sampler.py)
+ - Active learning coordinator that collects labels and triggers retrains (services/autonomy/active_learning.py)
+ - AutoML (Optuna) wrapper for candidate generation (services/autonomy/automl_optuna.py)
+ - Trainer orchestrator (services/autonomy/trainer_orchestrator.py) to run finetune -> validate -> promote
+ - Serving decision engine (services/autonomy/serving_decision_engine.py) to choose model variants
+ - Policy engine (services/policy_engine/policy_engine.py) to declaratively enforce rules
+ - Explainability utilities used by autonomous components (services/explainability/auto_explain.py)
+ - Cost scheduler to shift heavy work to low-carbon windows (services/autonomy/cost_scheduler.py)
+ - Orchestrator agent (services/agents/orchestrator_agent.py) that executes remediation workflows on alerts
+
+How it fits into Aegis:
+ - Drift detector produces alerts that the orchestrator agent consumes.
+ - Sampler selects uncertain or high-impact examples and enqueues them in human_queue.
+ - Active learning collects labels and triggers the trainer orchestrator (retrain pipeline).
+ - The trainer runs AutoML or a fast finetune, runs validation (verifier gate etc.) and promotes only on pass.
+ - Serving decision engine selects model variants based on SLOs and cost profiles for each request.
+ - Policy engine enforces safety rules at inference and in promotion workflows.
+ - The orchestrator agent coordinates auto-remediation (reindex, retrain, kernel_tune) and offers human approval hooks.
+
+Operational notes:
+ - All services are scaffolds and must be adapted to your infra (auth, service discovery, model registry).
+ - Replace subprocess kubectl calls with your orchestration system (Argo Workflow, Tekton, etc.) for production.
+ - Ensure appropriate secrets (K8s, storage, service tokens) are configured before wiring services together.
+
